 "findings": [
  "ComfyUI's --cache-ram (start-profile default) is keyed by input signature, not by expansion parent; --cache-classic gives every expansion its own subcache. MV 5c's model node therefore hands out one weakly held copy per run.",
  "A module cache holding SeedVR2/WAN strongly kept 14 GB (WAN) in RAM after switching to an H3 method; on the test server private memory reached 58.7 GB with 26.6 GB resident and the next decode crawled. Replaced by weak references.",
  "WanContextWindowsManual gained the required input split_conds_to_windows; MV 5c fills missing required widgets with their schema defaults so a core update does not break the expansion."
 ]
